<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold"><span style=3D"font-size: 2=
2px;">Finally, a wearable for your vagina&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">There are, what feels like, a million wearabl=
es on the market that track everything from glucose levels to sleep. Yet, u=
ntil recently, there was nothing to address the one bloody thing that half =
of the world=E2=80=99s population deals with on a monthly basis: periods.&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">That's why Emm founder Jenny Button =E2=80=94=
 who, in 2020, found herself wanting Oura ring-style insights about her men=
strual cycle but no products available to provide them =E2=80=94 worked wit=
h engineers and biomedical scientists to make one.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Five years and thousands of prototypes later,=
 she debuted the world=E2=80=99s first smart menstrual cup, which recently =
raised $9m and already has a 30k-person waitlist, <a href=3D"https://media.=
hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWzxnn8tFlMlW7Ny6x43KS3ywW5NMkyh5HpQNpN=
7dHCvY2-ZW0W8wLKSR6lZ3nXW61JZKr5mNpTnVFZx4r4nC1LRW3tVRf38ZTmsyW8mbXLP3fW4Zh=
W1hzGx39dx_cWW9jkQc31GBmVMW5twZY73_jgyFW916n0S8ls621W8xfNTP4T3j7RW5xvQ0M2ng=
DsRW5bQRJD3Wth7QW3n2rSK8-rc-wW4vR5R07DvWpZW7-7dLJ4RTbV3W4vF3ln18xx8vW3G2tht=
1dqMkWVHRBQZ2Y9XlfW462VHC6qtmr3W7rBT4n2x0rnsW4JlDxX1zmvLSW2mShhB2f9prPW3xyJ=
9_4QBsnnW2jKBfg8BtRYMW9kMwlJ3JKPvcV6Zp_-4hkZfKW1GS8tb4SNJXnW1vFDxl36Gp0jN1q=
ZKkcDDD9Vf8r2MkP04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-l=
ink-id-v2=3D"RSHXRblb" target=3D"_blank">per</a> <span style=3D"font-style:=
 italic;">TechCrunch</span>.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">How it work=
s</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Like other menstrual cups, it=E2=80=99s desig=
ned to store blood, except it=E2=80=99s made from medical-grade silicone an=
d embedded with ultrathin biosensors that collect <a href=3D"https://media.=
hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWzxnn8tFlMlW7Ny6x43KS3ywW5NMkyh5HpQNpN=
7dHCts2-ZW0W5BW0B06lZ3krW7N7r6D8mRPhdW7lD24D7MVw-bN12wjcWQZKPSW3bHpv-5R8tcj=
W703hLY6hX9ppW7CKlfZ8t3smPMsZqbNRybqvW59hJrk1NBRqFW5myB3S2_Cr-NN3RT44BhL6X1=
VW0g0D7ryNv7W4xTXjr7YbGHcMVqrqFqmcwNW7K-vGq5R5LRNW8Z69qX4yq5MPW62HkyZ4yw369=
W2wg2gb7Bh478W5kdGkb4CY6Thf7MRvk204" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-i=
d=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"4i0sM3tM" target=3D"_blank">data</a> on the w=
earer=E2=80=99s menstrual cycle patterns, like:</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Daily flow rate <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Cup usage, so you know when to change it <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Period and cycle length, so users can track changes ov=
er time&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">That data =E2=80=94 fully encrypted and anony=
mized =E2=80=94 is sent to Emm=E2=80=99s app, where users receive personal =
insights about their menstrual health.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The cup offers 4x the capacity of a regular t=
ampon and, when not in use, can be easily cleaned with soap and stored in i=
ts charging case for the month ahead.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">The hope=E2=
=80=A6</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">=E2=80=A6 is to =E2=80=9Ctransform the resear=
ch, diagnosis and treatment of menstrual and reproductive health conditions=
,=E2=80=9D Button told <em>TechCrunch</em>.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">For example: endometriosis, a painful and often misdia=
gnosed reproductive condition that can take up to <a href=3D"https://media.=
hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWzxnn8tFlMlW7Ny6x43KS3ywW5NMkyh5HpQNpN=
7dHCtM2-ZW0W69sMD-6lZ3lxW1B6VCl1qBmyvW7-98ty2Q63Q_VTN9tf7KFvBSW8sCk0H1DtVz_=
Vy0xYG4YjMVDW4Fr7kh5ygTKNW3LS75V3P_r_mW83B2mb6_y7r0W69zV5Y919RvSW3xnZ5-58R5=
DcW6qdBxT7CDP61W7hS3-b91YcWQW3qhkfM7pbCDsW3hkYKV7RchxtW3vNWV45_r482Vkqf926K=
518mW5k3myg1V6DZTW49hKFD8ZNWCMN8Pm-sRfsKnLW3Y0C_y5PczkBf7VLtgj04" style=3D"=
color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"+yLGgSLE" target=
=3D"_blank">10 years</a> to diagnose, largely due to a lack of data.&nbsp;<=
/li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Emm wants to accelerate those diagnoses and g=
ive women a better, data-backed understanding of their bodies.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The product launches in the UK next year, wit=
h a US expansion planned for 2027.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:115%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:115%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">Period wear=
ables=E2=80=A6</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">=E2=80=A6 represent a new but burgeoning sect=
or within femtech, an industry worth an estimated ~$40B in 2024 and <a href=
=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWzxnn8tFlMlW7Ny6x43K=
S3ywW5NMkyh5HpQNpN7dHCv22-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3q1MPhbK6SnhSfW1-y8lX5wRlhnW8z2D0B32=
L3VDN7MsFGBhv066W8t-kZV323VNkW8L8ZFp4yXxc8W5Hxcnd2yZ0FMW82358840zp0GW6y8F5k=
5Tyc-PW71jXgd2xDfgnW6VDhQP89MJTQW5fXwv-4y3cmQW1Cfpxp7Pw67BW8hvvyj8SQ62lW2yv=
cr32YcpMrW5tZgT85hw-f9W1c8Zc61pQplmW34vSKd3n-kG6W6KytcQ3rZDPVW4pF3m273GVsJW=
1NG3fm4jZP02W3Z2txq6sssT6f1NnyTM04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=
=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"/5zJmn/C" target=3D"_blank">expected</a> to gr=
ow to $97B by 2030.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">And while Emm is a pioneer in the field, it=
=E2=80=99s not the only one working on smart solutions to address that time=
 of the month.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:115%">
<li style=3D"line-height: 150%;" aria-level=3D"1">In October, researchers a=
t Canada=E2=80=99s McMaster University released a <a href=3D"https://media.=
hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWzxnn8tFlMlW7Ny6x43KS3ywW5NMkyh5HpQNpN=
7dHCvl2-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3lyW8fpwD88F0Pn3W5-C9GH6C1C_kW8WWlkH8lnt1TW5P9mY49jSpC=
1W1CGHrM1Vgh-zW2bf0kd5y00JmV5Dp988z96p9W4BkRZQ4wjT5vW1ZNPGd3VvSnTW4sy5gC6ZJ=
9b9W12FMYC7jdscQW60dd8X467k0-W8k9pps6KhcQlW65QV-W2YghSfVGlkYK62ywCyW54m9Sm5=
gGcX-W1h5tk23XFKxdW5dHF3618nyqJW1SJyqs5hjhVTW1GNMd27LGBm1W7Dz40K4l5JNPN2HJ8=
s1CfMCJW8smry52gR6kHW7CbXS51QmYkTf6LMxH804" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs=
-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"daxi7iqM" target=3D"_blank">seaweed-po=
wered</a> menstrual cup that it hopes to eventually outfit with sensors to =
detect infections and blood-borne illnesses.<br><br></li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 150%;">In June, scientists in Switzerland unveile=
d a pad-attachable <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-=
Vf04/VWzxnn8tFlMlW7Ny6x43KS3ywW5NMkyh5HpQNpN7dHCvF2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3lhW5wrxyF=
